The only proper way to do a sacfest is to be a Wizard with the spell
of create monster.  Helps if you have 300 or more Pw, Magicbane, and
both the FoD and magic missile spells.  If you're not a wizard it can
be done but it involves a black pudding and well I've said too much.

If I find an early alter and am Xp:3 or higher, I'll hang out on that
level (otherwise I'll come back after I am Xp:3).  Anything that dies
near the alter gets #offered.  Anything too far way gets eaten (you
must be very careful not to starve to death early in the game).  I
find it best just to wander around the level, making sure to visit
each room before returning to the alter.  Once I get an artifact, I'll
keep the sacfest going until it is safe to #pray and then continue
down.



